---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Shop Finicky Bee | Vintage & Antique Collectibles"
  description="Discover selected vintage and antique collectibles from Finicky Bee, with each object connected to a story of research, collecting, and preservation."
>
  <main>
    <Header />

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">SHOP FINICKY BEE</p>

        <h1>Discover something with a story.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          Selected vintage, antique, nostalgic, and collectible objects
          discovered through the Finicky Bee collecting and research journey.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE COLLECTION CONTINUES</p>

        <h2>Objects discovered, researched, and ready for a new chapter.</h2>

        <p>
          Some objects discovered through Finicky Bee eventually become
          available to collectors and curious admirers.
        </p>

        <p>
          Each listing is presented with photographs, condition details, and
          available research so you can look closely at the object before
          deciding whether it belongs in your collection.
        </p>

        <p>
          Browse the current selection through the marketplaces where Finicky
          Bee sells.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section marketplace">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">WHERE TO SHOP</p>

        <h2>Find Finicky Bee online.</h2>

        <div class="marketplace-list">
          <article>
            <h3>eBay</h3>

            <p>
              Explore the broader Finicky Bee collection, including vintage
              and antique collectibles, books, oddities, kitchen and dining
              pieces, holiday items, and other discoveries.
            </p>

            <a
              href="https://www.ebay.com/str/finickybee"
              class="button button-primary"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Shop Finicky Bee on eBay →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Etsy</h3>

            <p>
              Discover selected Finicky Bee collectibles and vintage finds
              available through the Etsy marketplace.
            </p>

            <a
              href="https://www.etsy.com/shop/FinickyBee"
              class="button button-secondary"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Shop Finicky Bee on Etsy →
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section mission">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">SUPPORT THE WORK</p>

        <h2>Every purchase helps sustain the journey.</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee is an independent collecting and research project.
          Purchases help support the time, research, documentation,
          photography, preservation, and storytelling behind the collection.
        </p>

        <p>
          Marketplace orders, messages, returns, and transaction-related
          communication are handled through the marketplace associated with
          the purchase.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section finds-link">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">BEFORE THE SHOP</p>

        <h2>Every object has a story before it becomes a listing.</h2>

        <p>
          Follow selected discoveries through the Finicky Bee Finds
          documentary series and see the research and documentation behind
          the objects.
        </p>

        <a href="/finds" class="text-link">
          Explore Finicky Bee Finds →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div>
        <p class="footer-brand">FINICKY BEE</p>
        <p>Preserving Moments in Time — One Collectible at a Time.</p>
      </div>

            <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/finds">Finicky Bee Finds</a>
        <a href="/collection">Collection</a>
        <a href="/research">Research</a>
        <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
      </div>

      <p class="copyright">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Finicky Bee. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f3ea;
    color: #2f302c;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  .page-hero {
    padding: 110px 24px 90px;
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .section {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 90px 24px;
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #d4a437;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .marketplace {
    background: #ece7da;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .marketplace-list {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 45px auto 0;
  }

  .marketplace-list article {
    padding: 35px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #d4a437;
  }

  .marketplace-list article:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d4a437;
  }

  .marketplace-list p {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid #2f4f3f;
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .button-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: #2f4f3f;
  }

  .button:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .mission {
    background: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .finds-link {
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .finds-link h2 {
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .finds-link .text-link {
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .text-link {
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .text-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .site-footer {
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
    padding: 55px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    color: #d4a437;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px 22px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .copyright {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding-top: 25px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 243, 234, 0.2);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .header-inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    nav {
      gap: 12px 18px;
    }

    .page-hero {
      padding: 80px 24px 70px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 65px 24px;
    }

    .site-footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .copyright {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>